#: ../../source/guides/docs/index.rst:9
msgid ""
"Read :doc:`organisation` first, even for a one-paragraph correction. The "
"site is arranged on three axes at once, and a page filed on the wrong one"
" is worse than a page that does not exist: it makes the reader believe "
"they have found the answer."
msgstr ""

